PRIVACY POLICY

Ruler Pro

We are committed to protecting your privacy. In short: the App does not collect,
store, or share any personal information, and it works entirely offline.


1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

We do not collect any personal information.

The App does not require you to create an account, sign in, or provide any
personal details such as your name, email address, phone number, or location.
We do not collect, transmit, sell, or share any personal or sensitive user data.


2. DEVICE SENSORS

To provide the spirit level (bubble level) feature, the App reads data from your
device's motion sensor (accelerometer) in real time. This sensor data is used
only on your device to display the current tilt angle and bubble position while
you use the level. It is processed live, is never recorded, stored, or
transmitted, and leaves no trace once you close the screen.


3. INFORMATION STORED ON YOUR DEVICE

The App saves your preferences and settings locally on your device only, such as:
- Your selected unit (millimeters, centimeters, or inches)
- Your screen calibration value
- Ruler orientation and display options
- Keep-screen-on and haptic feedback preferences

This information is stored solely on your device, is never uploaded to us or any
third party, and is permanently removed when you uninstall the App.


4. INTERNET ACCESS

The App does not request internet access and does not connect to the internet.
No data is sent off your device.


5. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

The App does not include any advertising networks, analytics tools, trackers, or
other third-party software development kits (SDKs). We do not share information
with any third parties because we do not collect any.


6. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

The App is suitable for all ages and does not collect any personal information
from anyone, including children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect
data from children. The App contains no ads and no in-app purchases.


7. DATA SECURITY

Because the App does not collect or transmit any personal data, there is no
personal information that could be exposed in a data breach. All settings remain
private on your device.


8. PERMISSIONS

The App uses the following device capability:
- Motion sensor / accelerometer: used only to power the spirit level feature, as
  described in Section 2. This feature is optional, and the App functions without
  it on devices that have no accelerometer.

The App requests no other sensitive permissions (no location, camera, microphone,
contacts, storage, or phone permissions).


9. YOUR RIGHTS

Since we do not collect any personal data, there is no personal information for
us to access, correct, or delete. You can remove all locally stored preferences
at any time by uninstalling the App.


10. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted
on this page with an updated effective date. If we ever introduce features that
collect data, we will update this policy and the App's Google Play Data Safety
information accordingly before doing so.


